{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Task: Create a "Full-Height Hero" where the image occupies the maximum vertical space possible, leaving zero padding at the top and bottom.
    
    1. Space & Alignment (The Fix):
    
    Height: Force the section to exactly 100vh.
    
    Paddings: Set Top Padding to 0 and Bottom Padding to 0.
    
    Vertical Stretch: Align the content to occupy the entire vertical height. Ensure there is no empty space between the header and this section.
    
    2. Image Scale:
    
    Main Visual: Place a transparent product image in the center.
    
    Size Instruction: Set the image to "Fill Height" or "Large". The product must appear to almost touch the top and the bottom of the screen to eliminate white gaps.
    
    Constraint: No titles, no subtitles, no background elements.
    
    3. Scroll Indicator (Anchored):
    
    Position: Anchor the "VER MÁS" text and the arrow icon to the absolute bottom of the section.
    
    Design: Minimalist downward arrow with a slow, continuous pulsing animation.
    
    Typography: Use a clean, sans-serif font for "VER MÁS" with wide letter-spacing.
    
    4. Styling:
    
    Background: Pure White (#FFFFFF).
    
    Minimalism: Ensure the design feels like a full-screen application interface, not a standard website section., Task: Reconfigure the "Full Height Hero" to eliminate all excessive empty white space around the image. The section must be a tight, vertically compact container focused entirely on the image and the bottom indicator.
    
    1. Forced Layout Reset (The Spacing Fix):
    
    Zero Margin & Padding: Apply margin: 0 !important;, padding: 0 !important;, and line-height: 0; to the main section and all its inner containers.
    
    Container Sizing: Set the container's height to be determined by its content (e.g., height: auto), not a forced 100vh canvas. It must shrink-wrap the image.
    
    2. Maximum Image Impact:
    
    Content Ocupancy: Use the image of the person holding the checkered bag. Set its height to occupy 90-95% of the entire section's vertical height, reducing empty padding to near zero. Use object-fit: contain and ensure it has no internal padding.
    
    Constraint: DO NOT add any background text, decorative overlays, titles, descriptions, or "Explore" buttons within this section.
    
    3. Minimalist Footer Indicator (No Offset):
    
    Position: Absolute bottom center, anchored at bottom: 5px from the very edge of the container. It must have zero internal padding.
    
    Components: A small, sleek downward-pointing arrow and the text "VER MÁS".
    
    Typography: Small, clean, sans-serif, uppercase with wide 5px letter-spacing.
    
    Animation: Apply a subtle "Bobbing" effect to the arrow icon without adding vertical space.
    
    4. High-End Aesthetic:
    
    Background: Pure Solid White (#FFFFFF).
    
    Hardware Acceleration: Use transform: translate3d(0,0,0) to ensure smooth performance on mobile.
    
    Fade-in: Ensure the image has a soft opacity: 0 to opacity: 1 fade-in transition upon loading.
    
    5. Technical: Use the unique CSS prefix .compact-visual-hero-. Force the removal of any "Section Padding" settings from the Shopify theme editor.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .compact-visual-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    line-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .compact-visual-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    line-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .compact-visual-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    line-height: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .compact-visual-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: {{ block.settings.image_max_height }}vh;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: compact-visual-hero-fadein-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.fade_duration }}s ease-in-out forwards;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  }

  .compact-visual-hero-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 80vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
  }

  .compact-visual-hero-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 500px;
  }

.compact-visual-hero-scroll-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: {{ block.settings.indicator_bottom_spacing }}px;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%) translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 0px;  ← AQUÍ ESTÁ
  z-index: 10;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: -30px 16px;
  min-width: max-content;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

  .compact-visual-hero-scroll-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.indicator_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.indicator_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.indicator_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.indicator_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.indicator_color }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.letter_spacing }}px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .compact-visual-hero-scroll-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.indicator_color }};
    margin: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    animation: compact-visual-hero-bob-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}s ease-in-out infinite;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
  }

  @keyframes compact-visual-hero-fadein-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  @keyframes compact-visual-hero-bob-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate3d(0, 6px, 0);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .compact-visual-hero-scroll-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.indicator_text_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .compact-visual-hero-scroll-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.arrow_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.arrow_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .compact-visual-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-height: {{ block.settings.image_max_height_mobile }}vh;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<compact-visual-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="compact-visual-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="compact-visual-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="compact-visual-hero-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.hero_image %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.hero_image.alt | escape }}"
          loading="eager"
          width="{{ block.settings.hero_image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.hero_image.height }}"
          class="compact-visual-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="compact-visual-hero-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.show_scroll_indicator %}
      <div class="compact-visual-hero-scroll-indicator-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <p class="compact-visual-hero-scroll-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.scroll_text }}</p>
        <svg
          class="compact-visual-hero-scroll-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
        >
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</compact-visual-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CompactVisualHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.optimizeRendering();
      }

      optimizeRendering() {
        const image = this.querySelector('.compact-visual-hero-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (image) {
          image.style.willChange = 'opacity';
          image.addEventListener('load', () => {
            setTimeout(() => {
              image.style.willChange = 'auto';
            }, {{ block.settings.fade_duration | times: 1000 }});
          });
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('compact-visual-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CompactVisualHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Compact visual hero",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "hero_image",
      "label": "Hero image"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_max_height",
      "label": "Max height (desktop)",
      "min": 70,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "vh",
      "default": 95
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "image_max_height_mobile",
      "label": "Max height (mobile)",
      "min": 70,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "vh",
      "default": 90
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "fade_duration",
      "label": "Fade in duration",
      "min": 0.5,
      "max": 3,
      "step": 0.5,
      "unit": "s",
      "default": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Scroll indicator"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_scroll_indicator",
      "label": "Show scroll indicator",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "scroll_text",
      "label": "Scroll text",
      "default": "VER MÁS"
    },
    {
      "type": "font_picker",
      "id": "indicator_font",
      "label": "Font",
      "default": "sans-serif"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "indicator_text_size",
      "label": "Text size",
      "min": 8,
      "max": 32,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "letter_spacing",
      "label": "Letter spacing",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 8,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "arrow_size",
      "label": "Arrow size",
      "min": 12,
      "max": 56,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "indicator_color",
      "label": "Indicator color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "indicator_bottom_spacing",
      "label": "Bottom spacing",
      "min": -20,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "indicator_left_position",
      "label": "Horizontal position",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "indicator_bg_color",
      "label": "Button background color",
      "default": "#FFFFFF"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "animation_speed",
      "label": "Animation speed",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 0.5,
      "unit": "s",
      "default": 2
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Compact visual hero"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
